{"content":[{"c":["ULAI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["River near the Persian capital city of Susa where Daniel received a vision concerning the end times (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.8.2-16","r":"Dan.8.2-16","rawR":"Dan.8.2-16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.8.2-16","value":"Dan.8.2-16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 8:2-16"},"). It is likely the same as the Eulaeus, which is described by both Greek and Roman geographers as a stream that flowed to the west of the citadel of Susa."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ulai","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Dn 8:2-16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.8.2-16","rawQueryValue":"Dan.8.2-16","sourceRefExact":"Dan.8.2-16"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"14c77eac188a53674ad48a954b385bd2fa5c933c4a6f96e9e2658a1f36fc7df5","sourceItemName":"Ulai","sourceItemOrder":4,"sourceMember":"Articles/U.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ulai","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ulai","title":"Ulai","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}